### Skill Decay Tracker API Tests

# Add a New Skill
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/add-skill
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "skill_name": "Python Flask",
    "confidence_score": 80,
    "actual_score": 75
}

###

# Add another skill that is "old" (Manual check: you might need to manually edit DB date to see decay)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/add-skill
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "skill_name": "SQLAlchemy",
    "confidence_score": 90,
    "actual_score": 85
}

###

# Get all skills with decay scores
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/skills

###

# Get interventions for skills needing practice
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/intervention
